  <div class="mb-chart-source">Taux de croissance annuel composé&nbsp;: 50,5&nbsp;%. Source&nbsp;: <a href="https://megaoneai.com/blog/generative-engine-optimization-guide/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Dimension Market Research, via MegaOne AI</a></div>
